{"unit_id":"tag:0DF6:proof","translation":"等式 <MATH_0001> 由等式 <MATH_0002> 得到，而后者由上述这些函子（functors）的描述显然成立。这就证明了 (1)。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n函子（functor）<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004> 给出位点（sites）的态射（morphism），以及相应的小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑斯（topoi）的态射（morphism），这一点已在《代数空间的性质》引理 <REF_0001> 中证明。推出（pushforward）的描述是显然的。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n第 (3) 项成立，因为 <MATH_0005> 和 <MATH_0006> 由包含（inclusion）函子（functors）给出，而 <MATH_0007> 和 <MATH_0008> 由基底变换（base change）函子（functors）<MATH_0009> 给出。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n陈述 (4) 由 (3) 通过与 <MATH_0010> 作前复合（precomposing）得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"推出"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"precomposing","target_term":"前复合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"上述函子及其构造；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"所讨论的函子；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"函子诱导态射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"位点及拓扑斯态射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"小平展拓扑斯；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"拓扑斯类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"对应的拓扑斯；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"推出","context":"态射的推出；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含","context":"函子类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换","context":"函子