{"unit_id":"tag:03YC:prose-0007","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在该引理的情形中，使用定义 <REF_0001> 的术语，有：对于 <MATH_0001> 这个层（sheaf），若它定义于大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）位点（site），其所属对象为 <MATH_0002>，则 <MATH_0003>。此等式由该引理中位点（sites）的图（diagram）的交换性（commutativity）显然得出，因为限制（restriction）到小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）位点（site），其所属对象为 <MATH_0004>、相应地<SPACE_0001><MATH_0005>，分别由 <MATH_0006>、相应地<SPACE_0002><MATH_0007> 给出。涉及拉回（pullbacks）与限制（restrictions）的类似公式则不成立。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutativity","target_term":"交换性"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"restrictions","target_term":"限制"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"等式的输入；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大","context":"大平展位点；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"大位点类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"层所属位点；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引理的图；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"引理的交换图；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"commutativity","target_term":"交换性","context":"等式的依据；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"小位点上的限制；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"小平展位点；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"小位点类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回","context":"不成立的类似公式；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"restrictions","target_term":"限制","context":"不成立的类似公式；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
